WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.984
A correlated scalar subquery can appear in SELECT
For each patient

00:00:06.195 --> 00:00:11.802
the inner query counts admissions for that patient
ID COUNT returns

00:00:11.828 --> 00:00:17.667
one scalar value so the scalar contract is satisfied
The result

00:00:17.694 --> 00:00:23.543
keeps one row per patient while adding an admission
count This form is direct

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:26.017
and easy to read for a simple per-row metric
